# Policy
- The file `reports/ssot_meta_index.json` must exist and be valid JSON.
- `make reports` MUST run `meta-index`.
- Dashboard `/api/meta/*` must serve the index without silent fallbacks.

# How to comply
- Run `make meta-index` locally (or `make reports`).
- Fix JSON serialization issues in collectors; no bare excepts.
- Ensure dashboard API endpoints return proper envelope format.

